{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23803","headline":"洛桥寒食日作十韵 · 白居易","name":"洛桥寒食日作十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上苑风烟好，中桥道路平。\n蹴球尘不起，泼火雨新晴。\n宿醉头仍重，晨游眼乍明。\n老慵虽省事，春诱尚多情。\n遇客踟蹰立，寻花取次行。\n连钱嚼金勒，凿落写银罂。\n府酝伤教送，官娃岂要迎。\n舞腰那及柳，歌舌不如莺。\n乡国真堪恋，光阴可合轻。\n三年遇寒食，尽在洛阳城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}